[{"start": 4.34, "end": 19.34, "text": "兄长啊,你回江东之后,替我多多拜谢吴王,感谢他的大志大写,在我军兵败之后,与我主再续盟好。"}, {"start": 19.34, "end": 21.34, "text": "此话一定带到。"}, {"start": 22.34, "end": 29.34, "text": "二弟啊,蜀屋联手抗曹,那是你我两家主公实施多年之国策。"}, {"start": 30.34, "end": 36.34, "text": "其间虽保京风雨,但长夜之后,艳阳重出。"}, {"start": 37.34, "end": 42.34, "text": "巫术之盟,定然是意志更坚,情意更浓。"}, {"start": 43.34, "end": 51.34, "text": "兄长自然是一片诚意,但不知江东驻文武,是否都像兄长一样心善。"}, {"start": 52.34, "end": 53.34, "text": "二弟此话何意啊?"}, {"start": 55.9, "end": 61.9, "text": "大凡盟约,都成见于危难之时,而毁于猜忌之中。"}, {"start": 62.9, "end": 70.9, "text": "比如说,曹匹一旦起兵伐蜀,并向东吴许以重力,相约同分蜀地。"}, {"start": 70.9, "end": 74.9, "text": "到那时,吴王还能恪守盟约吗?"}, {"start": 75.9, "end": 85.9, "text": "二弟言之有理啊,他若曹位起兵伐吴,对蜀许以重力,相约共分江东之地。"}, {"start": 86.9, "end": 91.9, "text": "到了那个时候,不知刘皇叔还能否恪守盟约?"}, {"start": 92.9, "end": 98.9, "text": "我蜀汉素以性意立誓,一诺千金,断不备约。"}, {"start": 98.9, "end": 104.9, "text": "我家吴王乃大智大贤之君,一言既出,万事不易。"}, {"start": 105.9, "end": 106.9, "text": "好。"}, {"start": 108.9, "end": 117.9, "text": "二弟放心,你我是同胞兄弟,虽各是其主,但都不会因我事而废兄弟之情。"}, {"start": 118.9, "end": 126.18, "text": "反之亦然,蜀吴同盟真可谓是骨断筋连哪。"}, {"start": 126.18, "end": 128.18, "text": "兄长说得好啊。"}, {"start": 130.18, "end": 134.18, "text": "弟还有一言,请待之陆迅。"}, {"start": 134.18, "end": 135.18, "text": "请讲。"}, {"start": 136.18, "end": 141.18, "text": "陆迅怡灵一把火,大败我七十万蜀君。"}, {"start": 141.18, "end": 148.18, "text": "马苏还告诉我,他在鱼覆谱,仅用几匹老马便破了我的奇门八卦阵。"}, {"start": 148.18, "end": 153.59, "text": "其才实功勋,不下于当年的周郎。"}, {"start": 153.59, "end": 157.59, "text": "弟对他又是欣赏,又是敬佩。"}, {"start": 157.59, "end": 162.87, "text": "经叛其自重,不要与我为敌。"}, {"start": 162.87, "end": 168.87, "text": "该把满腹才华用于保国安民,对付曹魏才是。"}, {"start": 168.87, "end": 171.87, "text": "须知功高震主。"}, {"start": 171.87, "end": 176.87, "text": "东吴前几位大都督都无长寿。"}, {"start": 176.87, "end": 181.85, "text": "一定待到。"}, {"start": 182.85, "end": 187.85, "text": "可此话的后半段,我只能奉怀于你。"}, {"start": 188.85, "end": 193.85, "text": "二弟呀,功高震主的是你呀。"}, {"start": 193.85, "end": 201.52, "text": "至于说到寿术长短,"}, {"start": 201.52, "end": 206.52, "text": "此时的刘皇叔不正是命选一线吗?"}, {"start": 206.52, "end": 207.52, "text": "丞相!"}, {"start": 207.52, "end": 214.14, "text": "幽长,有何事?"}, {"start": 214.14, "end": 217.14, "text": "丞相,陛下口谕。"}, {"start": 217.14, "end": 220.14, "text": "请你速速请功。"}, {"start": 220.14, "end": 229.87, "text": "兄者,弟就不送了。"}, {"start": 229.87, "end": 255.8, "text": "二弟呀。"}, {"start": 255.8, "end": 264.93, "text": "丞相来了。"}, {"start": 264.93, "end": 268.3, "text": "臣拜见陛下。"}, {"start": 268.3, "end": 269.3, "text": "陛下。"}, {"start": 269.3, "end": 295.2, "text": "当年,朕三顾茅庐之时,"}, {"start": 295.2, "end": 305.49, "text": "先生风华正茅,不足二十七岁。"}, {"start": 305.49, "end": 312.49, "text": "想不到,转眼间,你已满冰沧桑了。"}, {"start": 312.49, "end": 320.27, "text": "陛下识把臣于南阳山野,"}, {"start": 320.27, "end": 325.27, "text": "是臣一生中最大的荣幸啊。"}, {"start": 325.27, "end": 341.75, "text": "荣幸的是我刘备先生造成草中生相助,"}, {"start": 342.75, "end": 370.82, "text": "才有了如今的知识元气大孙。"}, {"start": 370.82, "end": 378.78, "text": "积攒的兵马潜流,也毁于你。"}, {"start": 378.78, "end": 388.38, "text": "我真是同传心扉啊。"}, {"start": 388.38, "end": 403.08, "text": "记得吗?"}, {"start": 403.08, "end": 405.08, "text": "臣记得。"}, {"start": 405.08, "end": 411.86, "text": "曹操雍君百万,"}, {"start": 411.86, "end": 414.86, "text": "谢天资一令诸侯。"}, {"start": 414.86, "end": 422.5, "text": "再者,孙世兄弟聚江东,"}, {"start": 422.5, "end": 426.5, "text": "以立三世,国险而名复,兵精而将武。"}, {"start": 426.5, "end": 430.5, "text": "将军只可联之为盟,不可屠罚江东。"}, {"start": 430.5, "end": 449.08, "text": "刘正已天下有变,"}, {"start": 449.08, "end": 457.66, "text": "率梁以出秦揣兴,"}, {"start": 457.66, "end": 471.38, "text": "胡江以营王事可行。"}, {"start": 471.38, "end": 478.12, "text": "都二十几年过去了。"}, {"start": 478.12, "end": 483.69, "text": "陛下,你还记得那么清楚。"}, {"start": 483.69, "end": 488.64, "text": "先生龙中之策,"}, {"start": 488.64, "end": 495.0, "text": "千古生生在而,"}, {"start": 495.0, "end": 496.0, "text": "甘霖。"}, {"start": 496.0, "end": 628.5, "text": "忠于陛下和太子,"}, {"start": 628.5, "end": 631.5, "text": "哪怕肝脑涂地,天崩地裂。"}, {"start": 631.5, "end": 635.5, "text": "臣没有任何非分之想。"}, {"start": 635.5, "end": 653.6, "text": "臣宁肯焚身碎骨,"}, {"start": 653.6, "end": 655.6, "text": "也要保有忠贞。"}, {"start": 655.6, "end": 693.14, "text": "臣何地自容啊?"}, {"start": 693.14, "end": 713.96, "text": "相父。"}, {"start": 713.96, "end": 751.02, "text": "陛下,"}, {"start": 751.02, "end": 755.35, "text": "启禀陛下,"}, {"start": 755.35, "end": 756.35, "text": "启禀陛下,"}, {"start": 756.35, "end": 760.35, "text": "文武大臣们都在宫外候旨。"}, {"start": 760.35, "end": 793.06, "text": "自于江东陆续。"}, {"start": 793.06, "end": 826.3, "text": "父王,父王!"}, {"start": 826.3, "end": 833.76, "text": "陛下,"}, {"start": 833.76, "end": 834.76, "text": "爱卿们进宫,"}, {"start": 834.76, "end": 856.5, "text": "梦想,"}, {"start": 856.5, "end": 860.81, "text": "如君如父。"}, {"start": 860.81, "end": 861.81, "text": "不知道,"}, {"start": 861.81, "end": 881.02, "text": "孩儿知道了。"}, {"start": 881.02, "end": 894.77, "text": "惠备了。"}, {"start": 894.77, "end": 897.46, "text": "高祖,"}, {"start": 897.46, "end": 898.46, "text": "裴峰,"}, {"start": 898.46, "end": 899.46, "text": "易忠,"}, {"start": 899.46, "end": 900.46, "text": "杨李人,"}, {"start": 900.46, "end": 902.46, "text": "姓刘氏,"}, {"start": 902.46, "end": 903.46, "text": "自纪。"}, {"start": 903.46, "end": 905.46, "text": "其父约太公,"}, {"start": 905.46, "end": 908.46, "text": "其母约刘敖,"}, {"start": 908.46, "end": 911.46, "text": "其先刘敖,"}, {"start": 911.46, "end": 914.46, "text": "长兮大泽之痞,"}, {"start": 914.46, "end": 917.46, "text": "梦与神域交融。"}, {"start": 917.46, "end": 946.79, "text": "你实在是太笨了。"}, {"start": 946.79, "end": 975.66, "text": "父王!"}, {"start": 975.66, "end": 1004.54, "text": "刘备,"}, {"start": 1004.54, "end": 1005.54, "text": "大业未尽,"}, {"start": 1005.54, "end": 1007.54, "text": "驾崩于白。"}, {"start": 1007.54, "end": 1011.36, "text": "十年六十三岁,"}, {"start": 1011.36, "end": 1014.36, "text": "太子刘善继位,"}, {"start": 1014.36, "end": 1019.36, "text": "书汉进入刘寇驻时代。"}, {"start": 1019.36, "end": 1090.03, "text": "吴蜀复盟,"}, {"start": 1090.03, "end": 1092.03, "text": "办得怎么样了?"}, {"start": 1092.03, "end": 1094.03, "text": "如主公所料,"}, {"start": 1094.03, "end": 1097.03, "text": "吴蜀已再接盟约。"}, {"start": 1097.03, "end": 1098.03, "text": "吴帝拱明,"}, {"start": 1098.03, "end": 1100.03, "text": "托臣拜谢主公,"}, {"start": 1100.03, "end": 1104.03, "text": "并称赞主公大智大贤。"}, {"start": 1104.03, "end": 1111.2, "text": "可小妹却去世了。"}, {"start": 1111.2, "end": 1114.2, "text": "自从刘备一临大败后,"}, {"start": 1114.2, "end": 1116.2, "text": "她茶饭不思,"}, {"start": 1116.2, "end": 1118.2, "text": "抑郁治病,"}, {"start": 1118.2, "end": 1122.92, "text": "最终无救。"}, {"start": 1122.92, "end": 1126.92, "text": "她生前虽喜欢冻萧,"}, {"start": 1126.92, "end": 1132.42, "text": "我用萧音一曲再送送她。"}, {"start": 1132.42, "end": 1133.42, "text": "主公,"}, {"start": 1133.42, "end": 1137.42, "text": "郡主何时故去的?"}, {"start": 1137.42, "end": 1140.42, "text": "四月二十五日。"}, {"start": 1140.42, "end": 1144.42, "text": "郡主与刘备之死近差一天。"}, {"start": 1144.42, "end": 1154.01, "text": "刘备死了?"}, {"start": 1154.01, "end": 1155.01, "text": "正是。"}, {"start": 1155.01, "end": 1159.01, "text": "臣刚离白帝城便得知消息。"}, {"start": 1159.01, "end": 1161.01, "text": "刘备病重不治,"}, {"start": 1161.01, "end": 1163.01, "text": "抑郁而亡。"}, {"start": 1163.01, "end": 1166.01, "text": "时为四月二十四。"}, {"start": 1166.01, "end": 1167.01, "text": "听见了吗?"}, {"start": 1167.01, "end": 1184.94, "text": "你的夫君也去了。"}, {"start": 1184.94, "end": 1194.85, "text": "他去陪你了。"}, {"start": 1194.85, "end": 1199.19, "text": "我们会在天宫中相遇。"}, {"start": 1204.95, "end": 1220.49, "text": "四月,"}, {"start": 1220.49, "end": 1222.49, "text": "刘备死后,"}, {"start": 1222.49, "end": 1225.49, "text": "孤无忧了。"}, {"start": 1225.49, "end": 1226.49, "text": "昔日,"}, {"start": 1226.49, "end": 1230.49, "text": "牛孙三兄定立于世。"}, {"start": 1230.49, "end": 1235.18, "text": "如今,"}, {"start": 1235.18, "end": 1243.54, "text": "只剩下我一个人见灾。"}, {"start": 1243.54, "end": 1244.54, "text": "主公,"}, {"start": 1244.54, "end": 1246.54, "text": "放眼天下,"}, {"start": 1246.54, "end": 1250.54, "text": "你是第一兄主。"}, {"start": 1250.54, "end": 1251.54, "text": "千鲲之属,"}, {"start": 1251.54, "end": 1253.54, "text": "必是主公。"}, {"start": 1253.54, "end": 1255.54, "text": "我高兴的是,"}, {"start": 1255.54, "end": 1257.54, "text": "刘备因关帐之死,"}, {"start": 1257.54, "end": 1260.54, "text": "一直恨我入虎。"}, {"start": 1260.54, "end": 1263.54, "text": "现在他一死"}, {"start": 1264.54, "end": 1266.54, "text": "朝中大权必然会落到"}, {"start": 1266.54, "end": 1268.54, "text": "你的胞弟朱葛亮的手里"}, {"start": 1269.54, "end": 1270.54, "text": "而朱葛亮"}, {"start": 1271.54, "end": 1275.54, "text": "下下赞同孙刘联盟抵抗曹军"}, {"start": 1276.54, "end": 1277.54, "text": "所以我料"}, {"start": 1278.54, "end": 1279.54, "text": "他只会北伐"}, {"start": 1280.54, "end": 1282.54, "text": "不会东征了 对吗"}, {"start": 1283.54, "end": 1285.54, "text": "臣恭喜主公"}, {"start": 1286.54, "end": 1287.54, "text": "奴才不知皇上驾到"}, {"start": 1311.29, "end": 1312.29, "text": "请皇上降罪"}, {"start": 1313.29, "end": 1314.29, "text": "司马姨在家吗"}, {"start": 1315.29, "end": 1316.29, "text": "在 奴才这就报致驾驻"}, {"start": 1317.29, "end": 1318.29, "text": "不必了 朕自己找她"}, {"start": 1319.29, "end": 1338.27, "text": "诺"}, {"start": 1338.27, "end": 1339.27, "text": "靖叔"}, {"start": 1340.27, "end": 1341.27, "text": "多日不见一向可好啊"}, {"start": 1342.27, "end": 1344.27, "text": "禀皇上 奴婢都好"}, {"start": 1345.27, "end": 1346.27, "text": "朕一直惦念着你呢"}, {"start": 1347.27, "end": 1349.27, "text": "愿你越来越好"}, {"start": 1350.27, "end": 1351.27, "text": "谢皇上"}, {"start": 1354.35, "end": 1355.35, "text": "接驾来迟 起罪"}, {"start": 1356.35, "end": 1358.35, "text": "仲达 快 快请起"}, {"start": 1360.35, "end": 1361.35, "text": "谢陛下"}, {"start": 1361.35, "end": 1365.62, "text": "朕今日高兴"}, {"start": 1365.62, "end": 1367.62, "text": "忽然醒到你府城来瞧瞧"}, {"start": 1367.62, "end": 1368.62, "text": "顺便"}, {"start": 1370.62, "end": 1371.62, "text": "送你一桩喜事"}, {"start": 1372.62, "end": 1373.62, "text": "敢问陛下是何喜"}, {"start": 1374.62, "end": 1377.62, "text": "刘备病死在白帝城"}, {"start": 1378.62, "end": 1381.62, "text": "朕去与心腹大患"}, {"start": 1381.62, "end": 1388.03, "text": "真是西从天降"}, {"start": 1389.03, "end": 1390.03, "text": "恭喜陛下"}, {"start": 1391.03, "end": 1394.66, "text": "刘备心丧"}, {"start": 1395.66, "end": 1397.66, "text": "属中人心不稳"}, {"start": 1397.66, "end": 1401.16, "text": "其后主刘善"}, {"start": 1401.16, "end": 1403.16, "text": "不过是一儒子"}, {"start": 1403.16, "end": 1404.16, "text": "断不足率"}, {"start": 1405.16, "end": 1406.16, "text": "加之"}, {"start": 1406.16, "end": 1407.16, "text": "夷陵之战后"}, {"start": 1407.16, "end": 1408.16, "text": "蜀"}, {"start": 1409.16, "end": 1410.16, "text": "元气尽散"}, {"start": 1410.16, "end": 1412.16, "text": "军力大自然"}, {"start": 1412.16, "end": 1417.78, "text": "朕出兵伐蜀"}, {"start": 1418.78, "end": 1419.78, "text": "你看如何"}, {"start": 1420.78, "end": 1422.78, "text": "陛下如要起兵伐蜀"}, {"start": 1423.78, "end": 1425.78, "text": "朕乃天赐其实啊"}, {"start": 1426.78, "end": 1427.78, "text": "实不相瞒"}, {"start": 1428.78, "end": 1429.78, "text": "刚才陛下到处"}, {"start": 1429.78, "end": 1430.78, "text": "刘备死训时"}, {"start": 1431.78, "end": 1432.78, "text": "臣已经在为陛下"}, {"start": 1432.78, "end": 1433.78, "text": "琢磨用兵方略了"}, {"start": 1434.78, "end": 1435.78, "text": "爱卿真是"}, {"start": 1435.78, "end": 1440.49, "text": "财思兴起啊"}, {"start": 1442.49, "end": 1443.49, "text": "页问齐强"}, {"start": 1444.49, "end": 1445.49, "text": "这个刘备死后"}, {"start": 1447.49, "end": 1448.49, "text": "蜀大权"}, {"start": 1448.49, "end": 1450.49, "text": "就落在朱国亮手中"}, {"start": 1451.49, "end": 1452.49, "text": "此人善能用兵"}, {"start": 1453.49, "end": 1455.49, "text": "其才远胜于其主刘备"}, {"start": 1456.49, "end": 1458.49, "text": "因此陛下如要伐蜀"}, {"start": 1459.49, "end": 1460.49, "text": "当行五路大军"}, {"start": 1461.49, "end": 1463.49, "text": "让朱国亮首尾难动"}, {"start": 1464.49, "end": 1465.49, "text": "如此"}, {"start": 1466.49, "end": 1467.49, "text": "方能成功"}, {"start": 1467.49, "end": 1471.59, "text": "哪五路大军"}, {"start": 1473.59, "end": 1474.59, "text": "第一路"}, {"start": 1474.59, "end": 1478.32, "text": "请陛下修书一封"}, {"start": 1479.32, "end": 1482.32, "text": "前使剑先碑首领柯彼能"}, {"start": 1482.32, "end": 1484.32, "text": "贿赂他金箔钱粮"}, {"start": 1484.32, "end": 1486.32, "text": "令他起精兵十万"}, {"start": 1486.32, "end": 1487.32, "text": "直取西平关"}, {"start": 1488.32, "end": 1489.32, "text": "第二路"}, {"start": 1492.24, "end": 1494.24, "text": "前使赏资瞒王孟霍"}, {"start": 1495.24, "end": 1497.24, "text": "令他起瞒兵十万"}, {"start": 1497.24, "end": 1498.24, "text": "攻取益州"}, {"start": 1500.24, "end": 1501.24, "text": "第三路"}, {"start": 1502.24, "end": 1505.24, "text": "令降将孟达起新城兵十万"}, {"start": 1506.24, "end": 1507.24, "text": "攻取汗中"}, {"start": 1508.24, "end": 1509.24, "text": "第四路"}, {"start": 1510.24, "end": 1511.24, "text": "前使赋剑叶"}, {"start": 1512.24, "end": 1513.24, "text": "与吴王修好"}, {"start": 1513.24, "end": 1516.81, "text": "许他灭蜀之后"}, {"start": 1516.81, "end": 1518.81, "text": "平分益州之地"}, {"start": 1519.81, "end": 1521.81, "text": "令孙权起兵十万"}, {"start": 1521.81, "end": 1523.81, "text": "攻取川霞两口"}, {"start": 1523.81, "end": 1524.81, "text": "竟取福城"}, {"start": 1527.22, "end": 1528.22, "text": "第五路"}, {"start": 1528.22, "end": 1539.4, "text": "陛下要选一智勇上将"}, {"start": 1540.4, "end": 1541.4, "text": "官邁大都督"}, {"start": 1541.4, "end": 1543.4, "text": "率十万精锐"}, {"start": 1543.4, "end": 1544.4, "text": "直取杨平关"}, {"start": 1545.4, "end": 1548.03, "text": "如此五路出兵"}, {"start": 1548.03, "end": 1550.03, "text": "大军五十万"}, {"start": 1550.03, "end": 1554.62, "text": "若两再有智谋"}, {"start": 1554.62, "end": 1556.62, "text": "也会故此失彼"}, {"start": 1556.62, "end": 1557.62, "text": "首尾难救"}, {"start": 1558.62, "end": 1560.62, "text": "即使不识蜀地"}, {"start": 1560.62, "end": 1562.62, "text": "也会失去汗中"}, {"start": 1562.62, "end": 1563.62, "text": "两地失衣"}, {"start": 1563.62, "end": 1565.62, "text": "蜀壁亡"}, {"start": 1565.62, "end": 1566.62, "text": "好方略"}, {"start": 1566.62, "end": 1577.0, "text": "好方略啊"}, {"start": 1577.0, "end": 1578.0, "text": "好像"}, {"start": 1590.84, "end": 1591.84, "text": "眼有未尽啊"}, {"start": 1592.84, "end": 1595.28, "text": "选哪位智勇上将"}, {"start": 1595.28, "end": 1597.28, "text": "做这第五路的大都督啊"}, {"start": 1597.28, "end": 1618.45, "text": "臣虽然不敢以智勇自徐"}, {"start": 1619.45, "end": 1620.45, "text": "但始终"}, {"start": 1620.45, "end": 1622.45, "text": "臣想亲赴沙城"}, {"start": 1622.45, "end": 1623.45, "text": "为陛下建功"}, {"start": 1623.45, "end": 1624.45, "text": "徐勇他"}, {"start": 1624.45, "end": 1637.58, "text": "是诸葛亮的对手"}, {"start": 1642.49, "end": 1643.49, "text": "但是你要记住"}, {"start": 1643.49, "end": 1645.49, "text": "永远要防着他"}, {"start": 1655.59, "end": 1656.59, "text": "爱卿"}, {"start": 1657.59, "end": 1658.59, "text": "重答"}, {"start": 1658.59, "end": 1660.59, "text": "亲赴至难"}, {"start": 1660.59, "end": 1669.47, "text": "你亲身负险"}, {"start": 1669.47, "end": 1670.47, "text": "你呢"}, {"start": 1670.47, "end": 1672.47, "text": "还是帮我"}, {"start": 1672.47, "end": 1674.47, "text": "运筹帷幄于中"}, {"start": 1674.47, "end": 1676.47, "text": "绝胜于千里之外"}, {"start": 1677.47, "end": 1678.47, "text": "事成之后"}, {"start": 1679.47, "end": 1681.47, "text": "你仍然是灭蜀的"}, {"start": 1681.47, "end": 1682.47, "text": "第一功臣"}, {"start": 1682.47, "end": 1683.47, "text": "臣遵旨"}, {"start": 1684.47, "end": 1688.38, "text": "令公子"}, {"start": 1688.38, "end": 1693.42, "text": "现居何止啊"}, {"start": 1694.42, "end": 1695.42, "text": "禀陛下"}, {"start": 1695.42, "end": 1700.03, "text": "臣现任洛阳主部"}, {"start": 1701.03, "end": 1702.03, "text": "这样吧"}, {"start": 1702.03, "end": 1706.3, "text": "朕"}, {"start": 1708.7, "end": 1709.7, "text": "嘉寿你为"}, {"start": 1709.7, "end": 1710.7, "text": "洛阳中郎将"}, {"start": 1711.7, "end": 1712.7, "text": "即日起"}, {"start": 1712.7, "end": 1715.82, "text": "随你父亲一到"}, {"start": 1716.82, "end": 1717.82, "text": "参议军政"}, {"start": 1717.82, "end": 1719.82, "text": "谢陛下天恩"}, {"start": 1719.82, "end": 1724.3, "text": "启禀陛下"}, {"start": 1724.3, "end": 1728.13, "text": "从昨夜三京起"}, {"start": 1728.13, "end": 1731.13, "text": "臣已接四道军情急报"}, {"start": 1731.13, "end": 1732.13, "text": "第一道"}, {"start": 1732.13, "end": 1733.13, "text": "显卑柯碧能"}, {"start": 1733.13, "end": 1735.13, "text": "领十万大军出汉路"}, {"start": 1735.13, "end": 1737.13, "text": "攻我西平关"}, {"start": 1737.13, "end": 1738.13, "text": "第二道"}, {"start": 1738.13, "end": 1739.13, "text": "蛮王孟霍"}, {"start": 1739.13, "end": 1740.13, "text": "领十万蛮军"}, {"start": 1740.13, "end": 1742.13, "text": "背攻我南部各郡"}, {"start": 1742.13, "end": 1743.13, "text": "第三道"}, {"start": 1743.13, "end": 1745.13, "text": "蜀中降降孟达"}, {"start": 1745.13, "end": 1747.13, "text": "竟然也奉曹匹旨意"}, {"start": 1747.13, "end": 1749.13, "text": "直攻我汉中之地"}, {"start": 1749.13, "end": 1750.13, "text": "第四道"}, {"start": 1750.13, "end": 1751.13, "text": "为打将军曹真"}, {"start": 1751.13, "end": 1753.13, "text": "领精兵二十万"}, {"start": 1753.13, "end": 1755.13, "text": "已经逼近杨平关了"}, {"start": 1757.13, "end": 1758.13, "text": "那个"}, {"start": 1758.13, "end": 1759.13, "text": "李延"}, {"start": 1759.13, "end": 1761.13, "text": "丞相知道这些军情吗"}, {"start": 1762.13, "end": 1764.13, "text": "微臣在黎明时分"}, {"start": 1764.13, "end": 1766.13, "text": "已经通报丞相了"}, {"start": 1768.13, "end": 1769.13, "text": "那"}, {"start": 1769.13, "end": 1771.13, "text": "那他为何不来上朝议政啊"}, {"start": 1772.13, "end": 1774.13, "text": "丞相不知何故"}, {"start": 1774.13, "end": 1775.13, "text": "病了"}, {"start": 1775.13, "end": 1776.13, "text": "列外卿"}, {"start": 1776.13, "end": 1777.13, "text": "你们"}, {"start": 1777.13, "end": 1778.13, "text": "可有"}, {"start": 1778.13, "end": 1780.79, "text": "退敌之策啊"}, {"start": 1781.79, "end": 1782.79, "text": "陛下"}, {"start": 1782.79, "end": 1784.79, "text": "由丞相在"}, {"start": 1784.79, "end": 1794.6, "text": "范兵定然可退"}, {"start": 1794.6, "end": 1795.6, "text": "孰悍无忧"}, {"start": 1795.6, "end": 1796.6, "text": "那"}, {"start": 1796.6, "end": 1797.6, "text": "那他不来上朝议政啊"}, {"start": 1799.6, "end": 1800.6, "text": "以臣之余见"}, {"start": 1801.6, "end": 1803.6, "text": "假如丞相称病不朝"}, {"start": 1803.6, "end": 1805.6, "text": "恰恰证明丞相"}, {"start": 1805.6, "end": 1806.6, "text": "正在苦思"}, {"start": 1806.6, "end": 1807.6, "text": "退敌之策"}, {"start": 1809.6, "end": 1810.6, "text": "那"}, {"start": 1810.6, "end": 1811.6, "text": "那"}, {"start": 1811.6, "end": 1812.6, "text": "那"}, {"start": 1812.6, "end": 1813.6, "text": "那"}, {"start": 1835.59, "end": 1836.59, "text": "相父安乐逢"}, {"start": 1838.59, "end": 1839.59, "text": "是陛下"}, {"start": 1839.59, "end": 1840.59, "text": "臣失敬"}, {"start": 1840.59, "end": 1841.59, "text": "告罪告罪"}, {"start": 1842.59, "end": 1843.59, "text": "相父"}, {"start": 1843.59, "end": 1845.59, "text": "你独自在此看鱼"}, {"start": 1845.59, "end": 1847.59, "text": "满朝文物都在看着你呢"}, {"start": 1849.59, "end": 1850.59, "text": "禀陛下"}, {"start": 1850.59, "end": 1851.59, "text": "臣并非在观鱼"}, {"start": 1852.59, "end": 1854.59, "text": "乃是在观范兵的动向"}, {"start": 1855.59, "end": 1856.59, "text": "相父你不必再看了"}, {"start": 1856.59, "end": 1857.59, "text": "朕告诉你"}, {"start": 1857.59, "end": 1859.59, "text": "共有四路敌军来犯"}, {"start": 1860.59, "end": 1862.59, "text": "陛下能说出是哪四路"}, {"start": 1863.59, "end": 1865.59, "text": "第一路是藩王柯鄙能"}, {"start": 1866.59, "end": 1867.59, "text": "第二路是"}, {"start": 1868.59, "end": 1869.59, "text": "蛮王孟霍"}, {"start": 1869.59, "end": 1870.59, "text": "第三路是祥将孟达"}, {"start": 1870.59, "end": 1872.59, "text": "第四路是卫大将军曹真"}, {"start": 1873.59, "end": 1874.59, "text": "好"}, {"start": 1874.59, "end": 1876.59, "text": "陛下侃侃道来敌情"}, {"start": 1876.59, "end": 1877.59, "text": "令臣刮目相看"}, {"start": 1879.59, "end": 1880.59, "text": "那既然如此"}, {"start": 1881.59, "end": 1882.59, "text": "相父如何退敌"}, {"start": 1886.34, "end": 1887.34, "text": "请陛下入庭拜察"}, {"start": 1900.6, "end": 1901.6, "text": "陛下"}, {"start": 1902.6, "end": 1903.6, "text": "这四路敌军"}, {"start": 1903.6, "end": 1904.6, "text": "看起来来势汹汹"}, {"start": 1905.6, "end": 1906.6, "text": "但细细想来"}, {"start": 1906.6, "end": 1907.6, "text": "不足为惧"}, {"start": 1911.86, "end": 1912.86, "text": "你说得果然不错"}, {"start": 1912.86, "end": 1914.86, "text": "相父早有退敌之策了"}, {"start": 1915.86, "end": 1916.86, "text": "西平关这一路"}, {"start": 1917.86, "end": 1919.86, "text": "陛下只需派马超去镇守"}, {"start": 1920.86, "end": 1921.86, "text": "他在枪人中的威信"}, {"start": 1921.86, "end": 1923.86, "text": "被称为天威将军"}, {"start": 1923.86, "end": 1924.86, "text": "有马超在"}, {"start": 1924.86, "end": 1926.86, "text": "此一路无忧"}, {"start": 1926.86, "end": 1930.46, "text": "难瞒孟霍"}, {"start": 1931.46, "end": 1932.46, "text": "范兵四军"}, {"start": 1933.46, "end": 1935.46, "text": "陛下可派魏妍领一军"}, {"start": 1935.46, "end": 1936.46, "text": "左出右入"}, {"start": 1936.46, "end": 1937.46, "text": "右出左入"}, {"start": 1937.46, "end": 1938.46, "text": "以为移兵之计"}, {"start": 1940.46, "end": 1941.46, "text": "瞒兵们作战"}, {"start": 1941.46, "end": 1943.46, "text": "通常势勇寡志"}, {"start": 1943.46, "end": 1944.46, "text": "其心多疑"}, {"start": 1944.46, "end": 1946.46, "text": "若见一兵必不敢进"}, {"start": 1947.46, "end": 1952.81, "text": "杨平关这一路"}, {"start": 1953.81, "end": 1955.81, "text": "虽说是曹军十五万精锐"}, {"start": 1956.81, "end": 1957.81, "text": "但大都督曹真"}, {"start": 1957.81, "end": 1958.81, "text": "是徒有虚名"}, {"start": 1960.81, "end": 1961.81, "text": "前番在南郡"}, {"start": 1961.81, "end": 1963.81, "text": "曾被陆迅打得大败"}, {"start": 1964.81, "end": 1965.81, "text": "臣已派上将军赵云"}, {"start": 1965.81, "end": 1966.81, "text": "出镇杨平关"}, {"start": 1966.81, "end": 1967.81, "text": "坚守不战"}, {"start": 1968.81, "end": 1972.57, "text": "曹真素句赵云威名"}, {"start": 1972.57, "end": 1973.57, "text": "必不敢妄动"}, {"start": 1974.57, "end": 1975.57, "text": "时间已长"}, {"start": 1975.57, "end": 1976.57, "text": "曹真良境"}, {"start": 1976.57, "end": 1978.57, "text": "必然脱固退军"}, {"start": 1979.57, "end": 1983.74, "text": "至于孟达"}, {"start": 1984.74, "end": 1986.74, "text": "表面看是降了曹位"}, {"start": 1987.74, "end": 1988.74, "text": "但臣知道"}, {"start": 1988.74, "end": 1990.74, "text": "他降位是迫不得已"}, {"start": 1993.11, "end": 1994.11, "text": "孟达在新城等地"}, {"start": 1994.11, "end": 1995.11, "text": "拥兵自重"}, {"start": 1996.11, "end": 1997.11, "text": "一向不奉魏廷号令"}, {"start": 1999.11, "end": 2000.11, "text": "如果蜀不亡"}, {"start": 2001.11, "end": 2002.11, "text": "魏主曹匹会容忍他"}, {"start": 2003.11, "end": 2004.11, "text": "蜀一旦亡了"}, {"start": 2005.11, "end": 2006.11, "text": "他绝无生路"}, {"start": 2007.11, "end": 2008.11, "text": "此外"}, {"start": 2008.11, "end": 2009.11, "text": "孟达与李延"}, {"start": 2009.11, "end": 2010.11, "text": "曾结有生死之交"}, {"start": 2011.11, "end": 2013.11, "text": "臣已请李延修书一封"}, {"start": 2013.11, "end": 2014.11, "text": "着清训交与孟达"}, {"start": 2014.11, "end": 2015.11, "text": "小以厉害"}, {"start": 2016.11, "end": 2017.11, "text": "因此"}, {"start": 2017.11, "end": 2018.11, "text": "孟达必会脱并不出"}, {"start": 2019.11, "end": 2020.11, "text": "如此"}, {"start": 2020.11, "end": 2021.11, "text": "此一路贩兵"}, {"start": 2022.11, "end": 2023.11, "text": "又不足悠已"}, {"start": 2027.7, "end": 2028.7, "text": "此外"}, {"start": 2028.7, "end": 2029.7, "text": "臣为防止意外"}, {"start": 2029.7, "end": 2030.7, "text": "已密令张包"}, {"start": 2030.7, "end": 2031.7, "text": "关心二位将军"}, {"start": 2031.7, "end": 2032.7, "text": "各以兵三万"}, {"start": 2032.7, "end": 2033.7, "text": "囤于景要之处"}, {"start": 2034.7, "end": 2035.7, "text": "做各地救援"}, {"start": 2035.7, "end": 2040.26, "text": "相父真乃天神也"}, {"start": 2041.26, "end": 2042.26, "text": "你看"}, {"start": 2042.26, "end": 2043.26, "text": "一腰带血尖"}, {"start": 2043.26, "end": 2045.26, "text": "就将四路敌军打发了"}, {"start": 2047.26, "end": 2048.26, "text": "禀陛下"}, {"start": 2048.26, "end": 2050.26, "text": "退敌之策"}, {"start": 2050.26, "end": 2051.26, "text": "需要秘密进行"}, {"start": 2052.26, "end": 2054.26, "text": "丞相之所以脱并不朝"}, {"start": 2055.26, "end": 2057.26, "text": "就是怕走漏了消息"}, {"start": 2057.26, "end": 2063.65, "text": "寡人真是误解相父了"}, {"start": 2071.24, "end": 2073.24, "text": "相父还有什么忧虑吗"}, {"start": 2074.24, "end": 2075.24, "text": "陛下"}, {"start": 2076.24, "end": 2077.24, "text": "臣刚才观鱼时"}, {"start": 2078.24, "end": 2079.24, "text": "确实心存忧虑"}, {"start": 2080.24, "end": 2081.24, "text": "这水面上的鱼"}, {"start": 2081.24, "end": 2082.24, "text": "臣都看见了"}, {"start": 2083.24, "end": 2084.24, "text": "但水面之下"}, {"start": 2085.24, "end": 2087.24, "text": "有没有臣没有看见的恶鱼"}, {"start": 2088.24, "end": 2089.24, "text": "相父何意"}, {"start": 2090.24, "end": 2091.24, "text": "臣担心"}, {"start": 2091.24, "end": 2092.24, "text": "还有一路贩局"}, {"start": 2093.24, "end": 2094.24, "text": "谁"}, {"start": 2094.24, "end": 2097.16, "text": "又尝猜得出来吗"}, {"start": 2098.16, "end": 2100.16, "text": "东武孙全"}, {"start": 2100.16, "end": 2101.16, "text": "正是"}, {"start": 2102.16, "end": 2103.16, "text": "孙全"}, {"start": 2104.16, "end": 2105.16, "text": "不会吧"}, {"start": 2106.16, "end": 2107.16, "text": "他不是刚与我们"}, {"start": 2107.16, "end": 2108.16, "text": "重门和好吗"}, {"start": 2109.16, "end": 2110.16, "text": "伊陵之战后"}, {"start": 2110.16, "end": 2111.16, "text": "孙全之所以与我"}, {"start": 2111.16, "end": 2112.16, "text": "再度修好"}, {"start": 2113.16, "end": 2114.16, "text": "是由于当时"}, {"start": 2114.16, "end": 2116.16, "text": "曹魏大军正在进犯荆襄"}, {"start": 2118.16, "end": 2119.16, "text": "现在则不然"}, {"start": 2120.16, "end": 2122.16, "text": "如果曹匹许他于重力"}, {"start": 2123.16, "end": 2124.16, "text": "比如"}, {"start": 2124.16, "end": 2126.16, "text": "约他共分川蜀之地"}, {"start": 2126.16, "end": 2127.16, "text": "那孙全"}, {"start": 2127.16, "end": 2129.16, "text": "还能守得住某月"}, {"start": 2131.89, "end": 2132.89, "text": "为主曹匹"}, {"start": 2133.89, "end": 2134.89, "text": "其才智不及曹操"}, {"start": 2135.89, "end": 2136.89, "text": "但脚节不亚于奶腹"}, {"start": 2137.89, "end": 2139.89, "text": "三族鼎力相互牵制"}, {"start": 2140.89, "end": 2142.89, "text": "如果曹匹不能先稳住东武"}, {"start": 2142.89, "end": 2144.89, "text": "岂敢进一法属"}, {"start": 2145.89, "end": 2147.89, "text": "如臣所料不错的话"}, {"start": 2148.89, "end": 2149.89, "text": "此时此刻"}, {"start": 2150.89, "end": 2153.89, "text": "卫使恐怕已经前往东武了"}, {"start": 2154.89, "end": 2155.89, "text": "那既然如此"}, {"start": 2156.89, "end": 2157.89, "text": "相父有什么办法"}, {"start": 2159.89, "end": 2160.89, "text": "肃前使傅吾"}, {"start": 2161.89, "end": 2162.89, "text": "敬见孙全"}, {"start": 2162.89, "end": 2163.89, "text": "小以大意"}, {"start": 2164.89, "end": 2165.89, "text": "说明厉害"}, {"start": 2165.89, "end": 2169.42, "text": "使命不易"}, {"start": 2170.42, "end": 2172.42, "text": "那相父想派谁出使"}, {"start": 2176.17, "end": 2177.17, "text": "我早已司得一人"}, {"start": 2178.17, "end": 2179.17, "text": "照我看"}, {"start": 2179.17, "end": 2181.17, "text": "此人才干不亚于陆续"}, {"start": 2182.17, "end": 2183.17, "text": "他既有中勇"}, {"start": 2183.17, "end": 2184.17, "text": "又不惧腐祸"}, {"start": 2185.17, "end": 2186.17, "text": "他随臣多年"}, {"start": 2186.17, "end": 2187.17, "text": "常显出过人之志"}, {"start": 2188.17, "end": 2190.17, "text": "只差为蜀汉建立书兄罢"}, {"start": 2191.17, "end": 2194.47, "text": "禀陛下"}, {"start": 2195.47, "end": 2197.47, "text": "臣请命出使东武"}, {"start": 2198.47, "end": 2200.47, "text": "此行即便不能成功"}, {"start": 2201.47, "end": 2202.47, "text": "臣也定然"}, {"start": 2203.47, "end": 2204.47, "text": "尚不如君威"}, {"start": 2204.47, "end": 2205.47, "text": "下不失臣格"}, {"start": 2206.47, "end": 2209.23, "text": "右偿"}, {"start": 2209.23, "end": 2212.73, "text": "拜托了"}, {"start": 2219.04, "end": 2220.04, "text": "卫使在客栈中"}, {"start": 2221.04, "end": 2222.04, "text": "已经等好十多天了"}, {"start": 2223.04, "end": 2224.04, "text": "急不可耐"}, {"start": 2225.04, "end": 2226.04, "text": "这些日子"}, {"start": 2226.04, "end": 2227.04, "text": "更是天天催促在下"}, {"start": 2228.04, "end": 2229.04, "text": "想面见主公"}, {"start": 2230.04, "end": 2231.04, "text": "以便促请主公"}, {"start": 2231.04, "end": 2232.04, "text": "早下决心"}, {"start": 2233.04, "end": 2234.04, "text": "弃兵伐蜀"}, {"start": 2236.93, "end": 2237.93, "text": "急什么"}, {"start": 2238.93, "end": 2239.93, "text": "去告诉他们"}, {"start": 2239.93, "end": 2240.93, "text": "我患病"}, {"start": 2240.93, "end": 2241.93, "text": "不见任何人"}, {"start": 2241.93, "end": 2242.93, "text": "多拖延他们几天便是"}, {"start": 2243.93, "end": 2244.93, "text": "敢问主公"}, {"start": 2244.93, "end": 2245.93, "text": "在等什么"}, {"start": 2248.93, "end": 2249.93, "text": "曹匹"}, {"start": 2249.93, "end": 2250.93, "text": "不是说派五路大军"}, {"start": 2250.93, "end": 2251.93, "text": "伐蜀吗"}, {"start": 2252.93, "end": 2253.93, "text": "姑倒想看看"}, {"start": 2253.93, "end": 2255.93, "text": "那四路大军的近况"}, {"start": 2256.93, "end": 2257.93, "text": "然后"}, {"start": 2257.93, "end": 2258.93, "text": "再定进退"}, {"start": 2259.93, "end": 2265.22, "text": "主公"}, {"start": 2265.22, "end": 2267.22, "text": "依老臣之见"}, {"start": 2268.22, "end": 2270.22, "text": "不妨揚作应允曹匹"}, {"start": 2270.22, "end": 2271.22, "text": "答应他"}, {"start": 2271.22, "end": 2273.22, "text": "起兵伐蜀"}, {"start": 2274.22, "end": 2276.22, "text": "同时又不与他定准"}, {"start": 2276.22, "end": 2277.22, "text": "禁军日期"}, {"start": 2278.22, "end": 2279.22, "text": "这样"}, {"start": 2279.22, "end": 2281.22, "text": "既不得罪曹位"}, {"start": 2281.22, "end": 2282.22, "text": "又不负"}, {"start": 2282.22, "end": 2283.22, "text": "伐蜀之谋"}, {"start": 2285.22, "end": 2286.22, "text": "万一"}, {"start": 2286.22, "end": 2288.22, "text": "曹匹伐蜀得胜了"}, {"start": 2288.22, "end": 2291.22, "text": "咱们也能均分齐地呀"}, {"start": 2291.22, "end": 2296.18, "text": "禀主公"}, {"start": 2297.18, "end": 2299.18, "text": "卫使令臣传话"}, {"start": 2299.18, "end": 2300.18, "text": "说主公"}, {"start": 2300.18, "end": 2302.18, "text": "如果今日再不见他"}, {"start": 2302.18, "end": 2304.18, "text": "那就证明东吴执意"}, {"start": 2304.18, "end": 2305.18, "text": "与卫为敌"}, {"start": 2305.18, "end": 2308.18, "text": "他要回许昌复命了"}, {"start": 2308.18, "end": 2312.74, "text": "谷庸"}, {"start": 2312.74, "end": 2313.74, "text": "在"}, {"start": 2313.74, "end": 2316.14, "text": "传卫士商店"}, {"start": 2316.14, "end": 2323.03, "text": "主公"}, {"start": 2323.03, "end": 2325.03, "text": "舒汉使臣马肃"}, {"start": 2325.03, "end": 2326.03, "text": "奉诸葛亮之命"}, {"start": 2326.03, "end": 2327.03, "text": "前来觐见"}, {"start": 2328.03, "end": 2333.61, "text": "按照规矩"}, {"start": 2333.61, "end": 2334.61, "text": "属使来吴"}, {"start": 2334.61, "end": 2336.61, "text": "我三日前就该收到文书"}, {"start": 2337.61, "end": 2339.61, "text": "马肃此行急切"}, {"start": 2339.61, "end": 2340.61, "text": "他与蜀帝文书"}, {"start": 2340.61, "end": 2341.61, "text": "一同进的宫"}, {"start": 2342.61, "end": 2348.98, "text": "你也看看吧"}, {"start": 2349.98, "end": 2355.43, "text": "主公"}, {"start": 2355.43, "end": 2356.43, "text": "这道文书"}, {"start": 2356.43, "end": 2358.43, "text": "是诸葛亮亲笔写的"}, {"start": 2358.43, "end": 2361.43, "text": "臣认得他的笔迹"}, {"start": 2362.43, "end": 2364.43, "text": "曹匹前使来吴的事"}, {"start": 2365.43, "end": 2367.43, "text": "除了咕吁你们几个人"}, {"start": 2367.43, "end": 2368.43, "text": "没人知道"}, {"start": 2369.43, "end": 2371.43, "text": "连诸葛瑾也不知"}, {"start": 2371.43, "end": 2373.43, "text": "那诸葛亮为何就知道了"}, {"start": 2375.43, "end": 2376.43, "text": "莫非"}, {"start": 2377.43, "end": 2378.43, "text": "他真的料事如神"}, {"start": 2379.43, "end": 2380.43, "text": "诸葛亮在信中"}, {"start": 2380.43, "end": 2381.43, "text": "直言了他对那"}, {"start": 2381.43, "end": 2383.43, "text": "四路贩兵的御敌之策"}, {"start": 2384.43, "end": 2385.43, "text": "可见"}, {"start": 2386.43, "end": 2388.43, "text": "他早已胸有成拙"}, {"start": 2388.43, "end": 2389.43, "text": "早有布置"}, {"start": 2390.43, "end": 2391.43, "text": "主公"}, {"start": 2392.43, "end": 2394.43, "text": "诸葛亮虽然多智"}, {"start": 2395.43, "end": 2398.43, "text": "但他也经常故作疑兵"}, {"start": 2398.43, "end": 2402.54, "text": "或许此信"}, {"start": 2402.54, "end": 2405.54, "text": "就是他的一道医兵之计"}, {"start": 2407.54, "end": 2409.54, "text": "臣建议主公"}, {"start": 2410.54, "end": 2411.54, "text": "建下马素"}, {"start": 2411.54, "end": 2412.54, "text": "其真假"}, {"start": 2413.54, "end": 2414.54, "text": "一试便知"}, {"start": 2415.54, "end": 2416.54, "text": "如何试探"}, {"start": 2417.54, "end": 2418.54, "text": "主公"}, {"start": 2419.54, "end": 2421.54, "text": "可在殿前立一大顶"}, {"start": 2422.54, "end": 2423.54, "text": "注油烧肺"}, {"start": 2424.54, "end": 2425.54, "text": "在前壮士列阵"}, {"start": 2425.54, "end": 2427.54, "text": "直刀一带"}, {"start": 2427.54, "end": 2429.54, "text": "换马素入剑"}, {"start": 2429.54, "end": 2431.54, "text": "且听他如何说词"}, {"start": 2432.54, "end": 2434.54, "text": "如果马素说词空泛"}, {"start": 2435.54, "end": 2436.54, "text": "足见诸葛亮"}, {"start": 2436.54, "end": 2438.54, "text": "欺张生事儿"}, {"start": 2439.54, "end": 2442.54, "text": "主公便召入卫使"}, {"start": 2443.54, "end": 2444.54, "text": "当着卫使的面"}, {"start": 2444.54, "end": 2447.54, "text": "把马素置进油锅喷杀之"}, {"start": 2449.54, "end": 2450.54, "text": "如此"}, {"start": 2450.54, "end": 2452.54, "text": "便可向曹匹表明"}, {"start": 2452.54, "end": 2454.54, "text": "东吾法蜀之志"}, {"start": 2455.54, "end": 2456.54, "text": "反而"}, {"start": 2456.54, "end": 2459.54, "text": "也可当着蜀使的面"}, {"start": 2459.54, "end": 2461.54, "text": "喷杀卫使"}, {"start": 2461.54, "end": 2463.54, "text": "以此向诸葛亮表明"}, {"start": 2463.54, "end": 2465.54, "text": "五蜀联盟"}, {"start": 2465.54, "end": 2467.54, "text": "劳不可破"}, {"start": 2470.54, "end": 2471.54, "text": "好主意"}]